OL,3,GNEWSABridge not tested for years 'due
OL,4,Ato love locks'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bridge was unable to be properly
OL,7,Ftested for almost a decade before its
OL,8,Fcollapse due to the weight of padlocks
OL,9,Fattached to it, a council report says.
OL,11,FPero's Bridge fell into Bristol's
OL,12,Fharbour in October after suffering a
OL,13,Fmechanical failure two months before.
OL,15,FThree tonnes of so-called love locks,
OL,16,Ftraditionally attached to bridges as a
OL,17,Fromantic gesture, were removed during
OL,18,Fmaintenance work in August 2025, ahead
OL,19,Fof a planned #1.51m refurbishment of
OL,20,Fthe bridge.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
