OL,3,GNEWSABridge not tested for years 'due
OL,4,Ato love locks'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBuilt in 1999, a Bristol City Council
OL,7,Freport said test lifts of the bridge
OL,8,Fhad been carried out every three months
OL,9,Fto make sure the mechanism was reliable
OL,10,Fup until 2016, when the weight of the
OL,11,Flocks made this impossible.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
